    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I mwaka mukwoŋo me loc pa Belcajar kabaka me Babilon,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daniel oleko lek dok bene ginanyuta obino i wiye i kare ma en obuto i wi kitandane. Ci ocoyo gin ma en oleko-ni woko piny, dok otito kit lokke woko bene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daniel owacci, “Man aye gin ma aneno i ginanyuta i dyewor ki i waŋ lek; aneno yamo aŋwen ducu gubedo ka rubo pii me nam madit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yabo 13.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.17.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci cutcut aneno lee madito aŋwen gukatti woko ki i nam, kun lee acel acel nen pat mada ki lawote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yabo 13.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lee mukwoŋo nen calo labwor, dok onoŋo tye ki bwome macalo bwom ocur. I kare ma abedo ka neno ci giputo bwome woko giilo woko ki i nom giketo Ocuŋ ki tyene aryo calo dano; ci gimiye bene cwiny pa dano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok aneno lee mukene me aryone, nen calo ŋuu, Otino tyene tuŋcel malo; tye ki cogo riŋo ‘lakŋet adek i doge i kin lake. Ci gititte ni, ‘A malo, imwod riŋo madwoŋ.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ŋe man aneno piny, ci aneno dok lee mukene mubedo calo kwac, ma tye ki bwome aŋwen macalo bwom winyo i ŋeye; onoŋo wiye tye aŋwen, dok bene gimiye loc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.12.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yabo 12.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ŋe man oo i dyewor aneno ginanyuta, ci aneno lee me aŋwenne, ger miyo kom dano myel marac ma lworo noŋo oketo komgi woko, dok tekone dwoŋ ma pe wacce; lake ducu obedo nyonyo matek; obedo ka mwodo riŋo lee otyero woko lipwacpwac, ka doŋ onyono gin mudoŋŋe woko piny ki tyene. Onoŋo nen pat dok twatwal ki lee mukene ma gukwoŋo nyime ca, onoŋo tuŋe tye apar kulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.5+REV.13.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yabo 13.5-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abedo ka tamo lok i kom tune apar-ri, ci aneno tuŋe mukene dok otwi olot ki i kin luwote; tye matidi mo. Ka otwi, ma onoŋo giputo tune adek i kom gin mukwoŋo twi-ni woko ki tergi ducu pi wekke kabedo, ci aneno waŋ tye i tun lee man ma obedo calo wan dano, ma doge onoŋo tye ka loko lok mogo me wakke adada.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abedo ka neno piny i cawa meno pi lok me wakke ma tuŋ lee onoŋo tye ka lokone. I kare ma abedo ka nenone, ci gineko lee-nu woko, ka giwaŋo kome ki mac gityeko woko liweŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doŋ lee mukene-ne-gu gikwanyo locgi woko ki botgi, ento giwekogi ni koŋ gubed kwo i lobo pi oro ki kare manok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 24.30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.64"
